     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hello everybody, </span><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">I was using seewave to cut out some undesired parts of my sound files (some seconds at the begging and at the end), but when I save the cut files they are different from the originals. </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">The new files are correctly cut but it sounds different, and although I couldn&#39;t exactly detect the problem, I am guessing it is something with the intensity.  <br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">So, as I would use this cut files to run a PSD analysis I think this differences could give me wrong information. </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Also, another problem with the new files is that they are not recognizable by Raven, but I can open it with Audacity. So I can see that my script is doing something more to my files than just cut the seconds I asked for, but I still don&#39;t know what it is. <br>Does anybody have a suggestion on what it might be?</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">I attached an example of the original (example.wav) and the cut file (example.wavfinal.wav), and my code is below.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Thank you!  </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">___________________________________________________<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\">#Finding wave files#</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">sounds</span> = list.files(<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">path</span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">folder</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">pattern</span> = <span style=\"color:rgb(176,22,0)\">&quot;.wav&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">all.files</span> = <span style=\"color:rgb(195,136,7)\">TRUE</span> ) <br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles</span> &lt;- length(<span style=\"color:#000000\">sounds</span>) </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\">#Reading wave files#</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">list.file</span> &lt;- list() </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(195,136,7)\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">i</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(195,136,7)\">in</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(4,82,24)\">1</span>:(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">nfiles</span>))  <span style=\"color:rgb(79,79,79)\"> </span><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">{<span style=\"color:#000000\">list.file</span>[[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>]]= readWave(<span style=\"color:#000000\">sounds</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>]) }</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\">#Cutting the first few seconds# </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">t0</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(4,82,24)\">0</span><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">t1</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(4,82,24)\">2.12</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">list.cut</span><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153);font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px\"> &lt;- list()</span><br></div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#c38807\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">k</span> <span style=\"color:#c38807\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>:(<span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles</span>)) { <span style=\"color:#000000\">list.cut</span>[[<span style=\"color:#000000\">k</span>]]= deletew(<span style=\"color:#000000\">list.file</span>[[<span style=\"color:#000000\">k</span>]], <span style=\"color:#000000\">from</span>= <span style=\"color:#000000\">t0</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">to</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">t1</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;Wave&quot;</span>)  }</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\">#Cutting the last seconds #</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">t2</span> &lt;- 5<br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(4,82,24)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">t3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\"> &lt;- 7.97</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px\">nfiles2</span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"> &lt;- length(</span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px\">list.cut</span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">)</span><br></div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">list.cut2</span> &lt;- list()   </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#c38807\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">m</span> <span style=\"color:#c38807\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>:(<span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles2</span>)) { <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">list.cut2</span>[[<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">m</span>]]= deletew(<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">list.cut</span> [[<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">m</span>]], <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">from</span>= <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">t2</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">to</span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">t3</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">output</span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(176,22,0)\">&quot;Wave&quot;</span>) }</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># Saving  #</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#c38807\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">z</span> <span style=\"color:#c38807\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>:(<span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles2</span>)) { savewav(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">list.cut2</span>[[<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">z</span>]], <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">filename</span>= paste(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">sounds</span>[[<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">z</span>]], <span style=\"color:rgb(176,22,0)\">&quot;final.wav&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">sep</span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(176,22,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span>)) }</p><div><br></div></div></div>"
