     1,
     "<div><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:#000000\"><div>Dear Amanda,</div><div><br></div><div>Sorry for the late reply.</div><div>The problem probably arises because savewav() rescales by default to a maximum of 2^15 (16 bits).</div><div>You then need to use the argument &#39;rescale&#39;, for instance:</div><div><br></div><div><div># edition</div><div>s &lt;- readWave(&quot;example.wav&quot;)</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:#000000\"><div><div>t0 &lt;- 0</div><div>t1 &lt;- 2.12</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:#000000\"><div><div>scut &lt;- deletew(s, from= t0, to=t1, output=&quot;Wave&quot;)  </div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:#000000\"><div><div>t2 &lt;- 5</div><div>t3 &lt;- 7.97</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:#000000\"><div><div>scut &lt;- deletew(scut, from=t2, to=t3, output=&quot;Wave&quot;)</div><div># range values</div><div>range(s@left)</div><div>range(scut@left)</div><div># save as a .wav file</div><div>savewav(scut, file=&quot;example_wavfinal.wav&quot;, rescale=range(scut@left))</div><div>## check</div><div>res &lt;- readWave(&quot;example_wavfinal.wav&quot;)</div><div>range(res@left)</div><div>## oscillo() also rescales to the maximum so that the wave appears &#39;loud&#39;</div><div>oscillo(res)</div></div><div><br></div><div>You can safely compute a PSD on these files.</div><div><br></div><div><div>HTH</div></div><div><br></div><div>Jerome</div><hr><div><b>De: </b>&quot;Amanda Martinelli&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">amandaa.m...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br><b>À: </b>&quot;seewave GROUP&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">see...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br><b>Envoyé: </b>Mardi 5 Juin 2018 16:40:01<br><b>Objet: </b>[seewave] Problems with the cut files<br></div><div><br></div><div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:#000000\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hello everybody, </span><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">I was using seewave to cut out some undesired parts of my sound files (some seconds at the begging and at the end), but when I save the cut files they are different from the originals. </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">The new files are correctly cut but it sounds different, and although I couldn&#39;t exactly detect the problem, I am guessing it is something with the intensity.  <br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">So, as I would use this cut files to run a PSD analysis I think this differences could give me wrong information. </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Also, another problem with the new files is that they are not recognizable by Raven, but I can open it with Audacity. So I can see that my script is doing something more to my files than just cut the seconds I asked for, but I still don&#39;t know what it is. <br>Does anybody have a suggestion on what it might be?</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">I attached an example of the original (example.wav) and the cut file (example.wavfinal.wav), and my code is below.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Thank you!  </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">___________________________________________________<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#4f4f4f\">#Finding wave files#</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99;min-height:15px\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">sounds</span> = list.files(<span style=\"color:#222222\">path</span>=<span style=\"color:#222222\">folder</span>, <span style=\"color:#222222\">pattern</span> = <span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;.wav&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:#222222\">all.files</span> = <span style=\"color:#c38807\">TRUE</span> ) <br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles</span> &lt;- length(<span style=\"color:#000000\">sounds</span>) </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#4f4f4f\">#Reading wave files#</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">list.file</span> &lt;- list() </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99;min-height:15px\"><span style=\"color:#c38807\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span> <span style=\"color:#c38807\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>:(<span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles</span>))  <span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"> </span><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\">{<span style=\"color:#000000\">list.file</span>[[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>]]= readWave(<span style=\"color:#000000\">sounds</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>]) }</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#4f4f4f\">#Cutting the first few seconds# </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">t0</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:#045218\">0</span><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">t1</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:#045218\">2.12</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px;color:#000000\">list.cut</span><span style=\"color:#061a99;font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px\"> &lt;- list()</span><br></div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#c38807\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">k</span> <span style=\"color:#c38807\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>:(<span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles</span>)) { <span style=\"color:#000000\">list.cut</span>[[<span style=\"color:#000000\">k</span>]]= deletew(<span style=\"color:#000000\">list.file</span>[[<span style=\"color:#000000\">k</span>]], <span style=\"color:#000000\">from</span>= <span style=\"color:#000000\">t0</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">to</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">t1</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;Wave&quot;</span>)  }</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#4f4f4f\">#Cutting the last seconds #</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">t2</span> &lt;- 5<br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#045218\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">t3</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- 7.97</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px\">nfiles2</span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px;color:#061a99\"> &lt;- length(</span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px\">list.cut</span><span style=\"font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px;color:#061a99\">)</span><br></div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">list.cut2</span> &lt;- list()   </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#c38807\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">m</span> <span style=\"color:#c38807\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>:(<span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles2</span>)) { <span style=\"color:#222222\">list.cut2</span>[[<span style=\"color:#222222\">m</span>]]= deletew(<span style=\"color:#222222\">list.cut</span> [[<span style=\"color:#222222\">m</span>]], <span style=\"color:#222222\">from</span>= <span style=\"color:#222222\">t2</span>, <span style=\"color:#222222\">to</span>=<span style=\"color:#222222\">t3</span>, <span style=\"color:#222222\">output</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;Wave&quot;</span>) }</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#4f4f4f\"># Saving  #</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:#061a99\"><span style=\"color:#c38807\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">z</span> <span style=\"color:#c38807\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>:(<span style=\"color:#000000\">nfiles2</span>)) { savewav(<span style=\"color:#000000\">list.cut2</span>[[<span style=\"color:#000000\">z</span>]], <span style=\"color:#000000\">filename</span>= paste(<span style=\"color:#000000\">sounds</span>[[<span style=\"color:#000000\">z</span>]], <span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;final.wav&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">sep</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;&quot;</span>)) }</p><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></div></div></div>"
